<title>POLAND: BUDIMEX Q1 NET RISES/FALLS TO PLN.</title>
<headline>BUDIMEX Q1 NET RISES/FALLS TO PLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Budimex preliminary results</p>
<p>for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			4.16  vs    1.56</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			  4.12  vs    4.30</p>
<p>    net profit				3.76  vs    4.16</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Budimex SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				69.38  vs   55.62</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 59.65  vs   54.32</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   na   vs    0.04</p>
<p>    income tax				0.36  vs    0.14</p>
<p>    other taxes				na   vs     na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   43.86  vs   48.29</p>
<p>    financial costs			43.90  vs   45.60</p>
<p>    investment				6.64  vs    2.40</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
